    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When people without money buy clothes: “Hello, how much is this?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "有钱的人买衣服：“你好，这个我要了。”",
      "traditional": "有錢的人買衣服：“你好，這個我要了。”",
      "pinyin": "yǒu qián de rén mǎi yī fu nǐ hǎo zhè ge wǒ yào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When rich people buy clothes: “Hello, I will take this one.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "非常有钱的人买衣服：“你好，这个，这个，这个，还有这个，我都要了。”",
      "traditional": "非常有錢的人買衣服：“你好，這個，這個，這個，還有這個，我都要了。”",
      "pinyin": "fēi cháng yǒu qián de rén mǎi yī fu nǐ hǎo zhè ge zhè ge zhè ge hái yǒu zhè ge wǒ dōu yào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
